        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d9636215-2490-4beb-91c6-f41a07834c7c\",\"review_text\":\"It was the best app but now it is the worst one the updates are so bad like why do I have to buy premium to forward a part of song?? what type of update is this no way I am gonna waste money on this!! Might as well stop updating and leave this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"bd937dc7-e123-4aa2-a633-abbde8a20c09\",\"review_text\":\"I listen to music on this app everyday. Only thing that I messed up is that I put shuffle and now I can't change it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"95094a48-2f0d-4e6d-91d5-e0d07619b8bb\",\"review_text\":\"It helps us to find our good vibes\"},{\"review_id\":\"0efd6996-ed9c-4e73-9faf-bce27fd63945\",\"review_text\":\"Paise chaiye bas inko\"},{\"review_id\":\"873e8c51-f4df-467d-855a-1ba35884e4ba\",\"review_text\":\"This app recent update is against LGBTQ\"},{\"review_id\":\"a41df73c-4199-44ee-909a-f0d1341cc5fb\",\"review_text\":\"i love spotify it has all the songs and its playlist are the best ! i wish premium didnt cost so much.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7d3f5db1-4076-4c2e-8561-01ee06664fa6\",\"review_text\":\"Soo many adds yrr\"},{\"review_id\":\"b7f0c40d-ebcb-499e-97c2-ec805a026a99\",\"review_text\":\"It was good for a long time until the shuffling function went down. Now it's only plays a small subset of my favorite songs repetitively. Sad that nobody in Spotify seems to take care of customer experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"964b4087-32d8-4746-b645-dab7f2c20546\",\"review_text\":\"I loved this app until now ...it removed all the basic features ..how is it even gonna function when one can't listen to what they want ??\"},{\"review_id\":\"3ef51825-2a7e-4294-aa64-84eb5d48800d\",\"review_text\":\"Love, love, love Spotify !\"}]}"
